        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jay Park\n- Organizations: 2PM\n- Products: Ultra Lover, 1st Japan Tour 2011 \"Take Off\", Go Crazy\n- Places: Makuhari Messe\n\nFacts:\n- In early 2010, Jay Park officially left 2PM as the group's former leader.\n- In 2011, 2PM's live DVD \"1st Japan Tour 2011 \\\"Take Off\\\"\" was associated with Makuhari Messe.\n- The single \"Ultra Lover\" was released along with 2PM's second live DVD \"1st Japan Tour 2011 \\\"Take Off\\\"\" in Makuhari Messe.\n- \"Go Crazy\" is the fourth Korean studio album and seventh overall album by 2PM.",
